  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Bosnia and Herzegovina. The main outcome areas it contributes to are countering the threats to democracy and human rights and promoting peace and dialogue. The main rights holders are underrepresented groups in Tuzla. Through capacity building of CSOs and popular education of underrepresented groups the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
